          "snippet": "Ratin Pedals Blue Angel - Effects Database",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Ratin Pedals Blue Angel | Effects Database Skip to navigation Brands &#9660; 0-9... a... b... c... d... e... f... g... h... i... j... k... l... m... n... o... p... q... r... s... t... u... v... w... x... y... z... Effect types &#9660; boost distortion fuzz overdrive acoustic simulation amp simulation speaker/cabinet simulation chorus flanger phaser tremolo vibe vibrato other modulation pitch shifter octaver delay reverb looper/sampler hold/freeze eq filter wah fuzz-wah bitcrusher ring modulator samplerate reducer wavefolder synth effect granular effect multi effect vocal effect talkbox vocoder buffer compressor other... Countries &#9660; (country unknown) Argentina Australia Austria Belarus Belgium Brazil Bulgaria Canada Chile China Colombia Costa Rica Croatia Czech Republic Czechoslovakia DDR Denmark Dominican Republic Ecuador Egypt Estonia Finland France Germany Greece Hungary India Indonesia Iran Ireland Israel Italy Japan Latvia Lithuania Luxembourg Macedonia Malaysia Malta Mexico Moldova Monaco Morocco Netherlands New-Zealand Norway Panama Peru Philippines Poland Portugal Romania Russia Serbia Singapore Slovakia Slovenia South-Africa South-Korea Spain Sweden Switzerland Taiwan Thailand Turkey U.K. U.S.A. U.S.S.R. Ukraine Uruguay Venezuela Browse by &#9660; Enclosure type Modulation type Special &#9658; Classics Eye candy Funny Vaporware Weird Random brand Random effect Events &#9658; NAMM Musikmesse Music China Guitar Summit More... &#9660; Forum (opens in new tab) myFXDB (opens in new tab) Newsletter About How to get listed? Interviews Reviews Effects explained Books D.I.Y. Schematics Links Contact Install Effects Database App Search the database browse by brand R... Ratin Pedals browse by type distortion/fuzz/overdrive overdrive browse by enclosure pedal Ratin Pedals Blue Angel Published on June 1, 2011 Ratin Pedals overdrive pedal Information Ratin Pedals This pedal is an all analog, natural sounding, soft to medium gain overdrive pedal that can produce wide varieties of tones suitable for blues and rock styles. This pedal has got an open sound like amps, rolling back the volume knob softens the sound and puts out a half clean sound. It's got 2 switches that help you get your desired tone easier. One of them deals with the dynamic range and the other with the tonality before the distorting stage. The dynamic switch enables you to choose between 3 distinct dynamic range, it starts from being too wide and open, which is the mid position, then limits the range in lower position and the then the upper is the most compressed, fat and sustained mode. The Fat switch, fattens up the sound, you can use it when the pick up sound is thin. This pedal works with 9 volt regulated DC adapter. Features: This pedal produces real blues and rock tones. High output , compared to other high output pedals True bypass , to maintain the clearest signal possible Equipped with Fat switch to enhance the tonal varieties 3 position Dynamic switch This Pedal react to your picking dynamics well Video all | by manufacturer | not by manufacturer Date &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Maker &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Video &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Time &#x25BC;&#x25B2; 2026-09-06 Ratin Pedals HIWATT DR103 + Blue Angel Overdrive | Ratin Pedals #shorts 0:40 2026-08-30 Ratin Pedals Blue Angel Overdrive into a HIWATT DR103 | Greco RR700 Sound Demo 9:27 2026-07-16 Ratin Pedals Blue Angel Overdrive | Custom Overdrive Pedal Demo through Hiwatt DR103 & Strat 9:32 2025-10-19 Ratin Pedals Blue Angel Overdrive Jr Boosted with an MXR ZW44 clone 1:00 2024-06-10 Ratin Pedals Small Pedal, Big Tone! Blue Angel Compact Overdrive Demo 4:20 2021-08-16 Ratin Pedals Blue Angel Overdrive with Humbuckers | Ibanez JS-1 Sound Demo 16:03 2020-08-22 BjornRiis Ratin Pedals Blue Angel review 5:04 2020-05-01 Ratin Pedals Blue Angel short demo 0:24 2020-04-18 Ratin Pedals Blue Angel Overdrive pedal by Ratin Pedals part 1 10:07 2016-09-06 PedalOfTheDay Ratin Pedals Blue Angel Overdrive Guitar