          "h1": "G4 Anniversary Edition",
          "description": "The Revv G4 delivers an organic unique voice of Canadian distortion. With a fat low-mid focus, this new V2 circuit revision adds additional versatility in lower gain ranges as well as a more clear cutting midrange, without sacrificing the liquid sustain Revv&#39;s Red channel is known for. Now available in a sleek Limited Edition enclosure colorway.",
          "snippet": "REVV - G4 Anniversary Edition - Revv Amplification",
