        {
          "url": "https://coastsonic.com/products/revv-amplification-g4-v2",
          "host": "coastsonic.com",
          "title": "Revv Amplification G4 V2 &ndash; Coast Sonic",
          "h1": "Revv Amplification G4 V2",
          "description": "Revv Amplification G4 Distortion, New, free USA shipping",
          "snippet": "Revv Amplification G4 V2 - coastsonic.com",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Revv Amplification G4 V2 &ndash; Coast Sonic Skip to content Search Home Shop Hi-Fives News Contact Account Search Cart Home Shop Hi-Fives News Contact Home Revv Amplification G4 V2 Skip to product information Previous Next Close Revv Amplification G4 V2 Regular price $229.00 USD More stock coming soon By Revv Quantity Add to cart Maker: Revv Model: G4 V2 Condition: New Description: The Revv G4 is an organic responsive high gain distortion pedal designed for player that like a thick low end endlessly sustaining solos. It's well-suited to a wide variety of applications genres with a unique smooth saturation chewy character you can really dig into with your picking hand. This brand-new V2 circuit revision adjusted the mids for additional clarity even when you've scooped your tone, as well as adding additional versatility in the lower gain ranges for a smooth transition from low to medium gain settings especially when using your guitar's volume knob. the red channel Revv's G-Series pedals are all-analog 'amps-in-a-box' based on the channels of our flagship Generator 120 MK3 amplifier. The G4 is the Red fat high gain channel. The foil to the Purple channel, if the G3 is a scalpel - the G4 is a sledgehammer. Plenty of gain on tap tons of thick low end make the G4 well suited to more scooped rhythm tones, round smooth solos, chewy crunch tones. three voices The G4 utilizes the 3 Aggression voices from our Generator tube amplifiers. In Red mode you'll get the most distortion the easiest feel under the fingers: a go-to for many lead guitarists. Blue is great for thick wall-of-sound rhythm tones. Due to its bass response smooth voicing, with the switch off G4 actually excels as a low/medium gain \"cranked amp\" oldschool overdrive. the technical details The G4 has a lot of gain on tap, so don't be afraid to set the Gain knob quite low if it's working for you. You can run the Bass high if you're going to boost G4 with an overdrive, but we otherwise find the sweet spot to be 9:00-12:00 for most players using humbuckers. It's a simple toneful all-analog pedal that runs on traditional isolated 9 volt center negative power supplies. authentic tone Our amp-voiced overdrive pedals have been a fan-favorite since the release of the original G3 in 2018. We take great care to not just make pedals that sound like our amps, but pedals that feel like our amps too. Tuned to work with a wide variety of amps even modeling setups, Revv's G-Series pedals are the best way to add boutique amp tone to any rig. features Thick high gain distortion based on Revv's Red channel. Powerful 3-band EQ dials just like a tube amp. Aggression voices alter saturation, compression, low end. Sustaining solos, scooped chugs, chewy blues-rock all in one. Simple 9v center negative power top-mounted jacks. Manufactured in Canada to rugged quality standards. design What's fun about designing for the Red channel vs the Purple channel is we largely get to focus on the differences in feel. Of course there are major tonal differences in the high end mids, but they're both versatile high gain channels. Purple channel is all about a fast attack Red channel is about a smoother more compressed tone, so we get to focus on that first then see where the sound takes us. That's why in addition to the modern rock rhythm \"bubbly neck pickup\" lead tones the G4 is known for - we've also found it has a dedicated fanbase of players using it with Aggression off for it's spongier feel colorful lower midrange when used for classic rock blues tones. View details Revv Amplification G4 V2 Close Revv Amplification G4 V2 Add to cart Need cables? Need power? Quick links Home Shop Hi-Fives News Contact Join our newsletter Subscribe Facebook YouTube Instagram American Express Apple Pay Diners Club Discover Google Pay Mastercard PayPal Shop Pay Visa Country/Region United States (USD $) United States (USD $) &copy; 2026 Coast Sonic . Your cart Close Checkout Close Your cart is empty Start shopping Close Join o",
