          "snippet": "Boiling Point — Rockbox Overdrive Pedal | PedalFilter",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Boiling Point — Rockbox Overdrive Pedal | PedalFilter | PedalFilter Skip to main content The guitar pedal database Search pedals The fastest, most visual guitar pedal database. All signal, no noise. About • Collections • Blog • Compare • Privacy Policy • Terms of Service • Submit a pedal • © 2026 PedalFilter Clear Compare ( 0 ) Back Home Rockbox Boiling Point Back to results Rockbox Boiling Point Overdrive Boost 3-mode overdrive with Plexi, Symmetrical, and Clean Boost. Bass boost switch for different pickups. Rockbox Electronics built the Boiling Point around a 3-position diode selector for tonal variety. Plexi mode delivers Marshall-like response. Symmetrical mode provides organic tube-like distortion with greater output. Clean Boost mode pushes amps into overdrive heaven. Gain, Tone, and Drive controls. Bass Boost switch accommodates humbuckers and single coils. Cleans up beautifully with volume knob for thick, creamy rhythm tones. Tuned with finest components to let your guitar&#x27;s natural sound shine through. True bypass. Made in USA. Demo Videos Specifications Power 9VDC Polarity center-negative Shop This Pedal Reverb Amazon Sweetwater Coming soon Using these links supports PedalFilter at no extra cost to you. ❤️ The fastest, most visual guitar pedal database. All signal, no noise. About • Collections • Blog • Compare • Privacy Policy • Terms of Service • Submit a pedal • © 2026 PedalFilter The guitar pedal database Search pedals You May Also Like 1981 Inventions LVL A3 Stompbox Awesome Benevale Colt 45 Previous Baby Blues Next Super 763",
