          "bodyExcerpt": "Silktone - Fuzz+ | Mass Street Music Gear Instruments Acoustic Guitars Electric Guitars Bass Guitars Banjos Mandolins Ukuleles Keyboards Other Instruments Pro Audio All Pro Audio Audio Interfaces Direct Boxes Microphones PA Systems Recording Gear Studio Monitors Other Audio More Gear Acoustic Amps Electric Amps Effects Pedals Pickups Accessories All Cables Capos Cases Gift Cards Headphones Humidity Control Microphones Slides Straps Strings Tuners Woodwind Band Accessories Brands All Tom Anderson Collings Don Grosh Dr. Z Eastman Fender JHS Lindy Fralin Mythos Martin Taylor Tungsten Amplification Squier Strymon Yamaha Waterloo by Collings More Just In On Order Vintage Used Local Popular Searches Sold MSM Merch Mass Street Merch All Shirts Sweatshirts Headwear Drinkware News Blog Events Newsletters Staff Picks Videos Just In Repairs About Contact Us FAQ Financing Join Our Team Shipping Staff Submit 0 Items - $0.00 Mass Street Music Gear Instruments Acoustic Guitars Electric Guitars Bass Guitars Banjos Mandolins Ukuleles Keyboards Other Instruments Pro Audio All Pro Audio Audio Interfaces Direct Boxes Microphones PA Systems Recording Gear Studio Monitors Other Audio More Gear Acoustic Amps Electric Amps Effects Pedals Pickups Accessories All Cables Capos Cases Gift Cards Headphones Humidity Control Microphones Slides Straps Strings Tuners Woodwind Band Accessories Brands All Tom Anderson Collings Don Grosh Dr. Z Eastman Fender JHS Lindy Fralin Mythos Martin Taylor Tungsten Amplification Squier Strymon Yamaha Waterloo by Collings More Just In On Order Vintage Used Local Popular Searches Sold MSM Merch Mass Street Merch All Shirts Sweatshirts Headwear Drinkware News Blog Events Newsletters Staff Picks Videos Just In Repairs About Contact Us FAQ Financing Join Our Team Shipping Staff Search Home &rsaquo; Silktone - Fuzz+ Click image to enlarge Appearance of new instruments may vary slightly unless Serial Number is listed Silktone - Fuzz+ $269.00 Default Title - $269.00 In Stock - Free Shipping Eligible The Fuzz+ from Silktone is a marvelous fuzz that has a wide breadth of tones with innovative levels of control. Featuring two tone controls--one for treble and one for bass--for well defined tone shaping. The leftmost foot switch allows for a raw mode that bypasses the cleanup and tone controls which gets right in your face like a raw fuzz should. The bias knob allows for users to attenuate the operating voltage of the pedal, ranging from that dead battery vibe, cutting out grit, to that growly, in-your-face buzz when cranked. The LED active meter showcases where your bias currently is, enabling on the fly malleability to contain a consistent tone. The cleanup knob will smooth things out as your fuzz gets cranked for a sort of overdrive sound mimicking the roll off on a guitar volume knob allowing for more headroom and open tones. Two Transistor Germanium Fuzz Two Tone Controls--Bass Treble Raw switch bypasses cleanup tone controls for thick, in-your-face grit Bias Knob attenuates the bias and is marked by the LED meter showcasing the current bias of the Germanium transistors 4.5 is the sweet spot, lower will give sputtery battery sound and higher will crank the gain into a spitty fuzz Fuzz Knob controls the gain of the circuit Cleanup smooths out gain, mimics guitar volume knob roll off for an overdrive sound with lots of headroom Requires 9v Power True Bypass Browse More Fuzz Pedals Browse All Effect Pedals Need More Info? Your Name: Email: Message: Free Set Ups We take the time to set up every new guitar, mando, bass, uke, or banjo for every player, whether it was purchased here in Lawrence, Kansas or on our website. Large retailers are content to ship you a guitar right off of the warehouse shelf, while we take pride in the fact that your new instrument will be set up to be truly ready to play - for you. Contact Us! Call us at 800-747-9980 or send us an email at info@massstreetmusic.com - we're here to help! All of us at Mass Stree",
