          "snippet": "Silktone - Fuzz+ - Gbase",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Silktone - Fuzz&#x2B; - Gbase Gbase - Guitars Amps More Gear Dealers Radar Events More Sections Gear Dealers Events Blog Account Join Login Create Store Help 1.0.731 Home Find Gear Find Dealer Gear Radar Events Blog Join Login Create Store Help Find Gear Effects Silktone - Fuzz&#x2B; Mass Street Music Description The Fuzz+ from Silktone is a marvelous fuzz that has a wide breadth of tones with innovative levels of control. Featuring two tone controls--one for treble and one for bass--for well defined tone shaping. The leftmost foot switch allows for a raw mode that bypasses the cleanup and tone controls which gets right in your face like a raw fuzz should. The bias knob allows for users to attenuate the operating voltage of the pedal, ranging from that dead battery vibe, cutting out grit, to that growly, in-your-face buzz when cranked. The LED active meter showcases where your bias currently is, enabling on the fly malleability to contain a consistent tone. The cleanup knob will smooth things out as your fuzz gets cranked for a sort of overdrive sound mimicking the roll off on a guitar volume knob allowing for more headroom and open tones. Two Transistor Germanium Fuzz Two Tone Controls--Bass Treble Raw switch bypasses cleanup tone controls for thick, in-your-face grit Bias Knob attenuates the bias and is marked by the LED meter showcasing the current bias of the Germanium transistors 4.5 is the sweet spot, lower will give sputtery battery sound and higher will crank the gain into a spitty fuzz Fuzz Knob controls the gain of the circuit Cleanup smooths out gain, mimics guitar volume knob roll off for an overdrive sound with lots of headroom Requires 9v Power True Bypass Mass Street Music Year Call Make Silktone Color Blue Condition Brand New $269 Trusted for Buy Now Visit Store See Inventory More Details Save This Save Contact Store Policies Mass Street Music 785-843-3535 Lawrence, KS 9:51&#x202F;AM Send Message 10am to 6pm Tuesday through 