          "snippet": "High Gear by Skreddy | PedalFilter",
          "bodyExcerpt": "High Gear — Skreddy Overdrive Pedal | PedalFilter | PedalFilter Skip to main content The guitar pedal database Search pedals The fastest, most visual guitar pedal database. All signal, no noise. About • Collections • Blog • Compare • Privacy Policy • Terms of Service • Submit a pedal • © 2026 PedalFilter Clear Compare ( 0 ) Back Home Skreddy High Gear Back to results Skreddy High Gear Overdrive Distortion Marshall-style overdrive pushing into distortion territory. British amp tones. The High Gear is a two-stage overdrive from Skreddy Pedals. While detailed technical documentation for this particular model is limited compared to other Skreddy offerings, it represents Marc Ahlfs&#x27; approach to gain staging — using two cascading overdrive stages for increasing saturation and harmonic complexity. Designed as a versatile overdrive covering clean boost through medium-gain territory. Like all Skreddy pedals, it responds dynamically to guitar volume and picking dynamics, cleaning up naturally when the guitar volume is rolled back. Handmade in Milwaukee, Wisconsin. True bypass. 9V battery or standard DC adapter. Demo Videos Specifications Power 9VDC Polarity center-negative Shop This Pedal Reverb Amazon Sweetwater Coming soon Using these links supports PedalFilter at no extra cost to you. ❤️ The fastest, most visual guitar pedal database. All signal, no noise. About • Collections • Blog • Compare • Privacy Policy • Terms of Service • Submit a pedal • © 2026 PedalFilter The guitar pedal database Search pedals You May Also Like 1981 Inventions DRV Abasi Pathos Behringer OD300 Overdrive Distortion Previous Giant Meat Pie Next Hybrid Fuzz Driver",
