          "snippet": "Skreddy Hybrid Overdrive Effects Pedal - Firehouse Guitars",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Skreddy Hybrid Overdrive Effects Pedal | Firehouse Guitars Home Used Repairs Lessons Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Guitars Basses Pedals Effects Amps Drums Keys Synths Live Sound Recording Retail Used Gear Repairs Plek Lessons Rentals About Us Skreddy Hybrid Overdrive Effects Pedal $ 205.00 Color: Gold Got Questions? Add to Cart Free Pickup from Grandville Ships from Grandville, West Michigan Warehouse All Skreddy All Instrument Signal Processors All Effects Pedals The Skreddy Pedals™ Hybrid Overdrive cleans up extremely well with the guitar volume and has an authentic rock voice like a huge early 70&#39;s British tube amplifier. This circuit has less gain and more headroom compared to the Skreddy Major Overdrive. Sounds nearly identical to the Hybrid Fuzz Driver (same oldschool-silicon-germanium fuzz stage) but has a stronger tone control for less high-end fizz and better ability to darken at min, an ever-so-slightly stronger low-midrange, and it stays punchy and cutting even at max gain, never gets mushy. Has a singing, vintage voice with plenty of gain just shy of fuzz and gets along with all kinds of pickups. The tone is focused but balanced. The attack is amp-like and cutting with dynamic overdrive that responds intuitively to guitar volume, pickup selection, and picking technique. Very reactive to the touch; notes are sweet, chords have excellent string separation, and there is plenty of crunch and growl while holding together and not going fuzzy and compressed. Features Hot blues/rock tones at your fingertips with emphasis on snarling yet transparent cranked-amp sounds Goes from chimey to raucous with your guitar volume and responds to your picking intensity with nuance and authority Plenty of twang and sparkle that doesn&#39;t get lost behind the dirt! Specifications Batteries 1 x 9V EQ Tone Control Effects Overdrive Features Battery-Powered Inputs 1 x 1/4&quot; MPN SKR-HOD Outputs 1 x 1/4&quot; Power Source 9V DC power supply (not included) Power Usage 2mA Processing Type Analog UPC 0000682500023828 Questions? We Can Help! ✉️ Email Us 🏴 4611 Ivanrest Ave SW; Grandville, MI 49418 📞 (616) 532-3473 4611 Ivanrest Ave SW Grandville, MI 49418 (616) 532-3473 info@firehouseguitars.com Company Our Family Story Meet The Team Showroom Tour Store Events Brands We Carry Service Shipping Policy Return Exchange Policy Pricing Policy Privacy Policy Gift Card Balance Repairs Connect With Us Sign up get the latest and greatest Join © 2026 Firehouse Guitars [[\"ShallowReactive\",1],{\"data\":2,\"state\":57,\"once\":74,\"_errors\":75,\"serverRendered\":72,\"path\":77,\"pinia\":78},[\"ShallowReactive\",3],{\"strapi-ribbon-navigation-cache\":4,\"brand-2817-cache\":26,\"product-page-cache\":50},{\"reminderText\":5,\"headingColor\":6,\"linkColor\":6,\"textColor\":6,\"createdAt\":7,\"updatedAt\":8,\"links\":9},\"**Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask!**\",null,\"2026-03-05T22:11:40.941Z\",\"2026-06-19T15:20:45.760Z\",[10,14,18,22],{\"id\":11,\"URL\":12,\"title\":13},26,\"\\u002F\",\"Home\",{\"id\":15,\"URL\":16,\"title\":17},29,\"\\u002Fused\\u002F\",\"Used\",{\"id\":19,\"URL\":20,\"title\":21},115,\"\\u002Fpage\\u002F1\\u002Frepairs\\u002F\",\"Repairs\",{\"id\":23,\"URL\":24,\"title\":25},118,\"\\u002Fpage\\u002F4\\u002Flessons\\u002F\",\"Lessons\",{\"name\":27,\"slug\":28,\"isFeatured\":29,\"brandId\":30,\"displayName\":6,\"createdAt\":31,\"updatedAt\":31,\"logo\":32,\"page\":48,\"collection\"