          "snippet": "Juicy Pig - Joe&#x27;s Pedals",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Juicy Pig &ndash; Joe&#39;s Pedals SHIPPING DISRUPTION: No international and a sporadic UK service 23rd Sept-12th Oct 2026 Skip to main content Basket (0) Log in Create account Help Pedals Accessories Used Blog About Search our store Juicy Pig by Skreddy Pedals $296.40 In stock Default Title Add to Cart Effects: Big Muff, Fuzz The Skreddy Pedals™ Juicy Pig is another modification of the circa 1976 \"rams head\" Big Muff Pi*. It is designed to enhance the clarity of the signal to provide all the gain and sustain of the original but with less buzz-saw grind and more amp-like transparency. Works even better with humbucker-equipped guitars; features a less-tightened low end, more natural frequency response, and more of a liquid sustain that grabs the guitar's frequency characteristic instead of adding its own. Near-endless sustain coupled with detailed string articulation and low-end transparency, melds with and bonds with your essential guitar tone, sustains and compresses yet sounds dynamic too. Power Regular 9v negative ground, no special power requirements. 9v battery is not included. If you use a battery, then remember to un-plug the input cable from the pedal’s input jack when not in use to prevent draining (or you can also just plug in a power-supply, which disconnects the battery). You may supply external power through an AC adapter. All Skreddy Pedals accept the industry-standard 9v DC plug (5.5mm barrel x 2.1mm center coax), negative tip. Please use a quality, regulated, filtered power supply. Similar Articles Lightspeed Organic Overdrive (WTB) $309.60 Lightspeed Organic Overdrive (Snow White) $309.60 Dungeon Crawler $309.60 View more joes-pedals-logo Created with Sketch. Purveyors of the finest bespoke pedals and stompboxes known to humanity Help Shipping information Returns Refund Policy Newsletter Subscribe Terms & Conditions / Privacy Policy Copyright © Joe’s Pedals 2026 Designed & Built by Buffalo",
