r power-tube distortion not required. The tone of these transistors is nearly identical to the NOS units the original Mayonaise used (they look the same, too). Made of the same types of parts as used in our first product ever, which was a sonic clone of the circa 1971 \"triangle knob\" version fuzz box. Has all that original pillowiness, grit, compression, and near infinite sustain as the original. Reviews Clips Similar Pedals P19 Skreddy Pedals Smooth soaring sustain $259 $233.10 Martian Tarantula Skreddy Pedals Well-behaved Tonebender Mk1 fuzz $259 $233.10 Serenity Fuzzdrive Skreddy Pedals Smooth, sweet, amp-like fuzzy drive $259 $233.10 Skunk Drive Skreddy Pedals Vintage cutting fuzz/overdrive like early Zeppelin $237 $213.30 Klipper Skreddy Pedals Huge, amp-like, Sabbathy fuzz $259 $233.10 Lunar Module Mini Deluxe Skreddy Pedals Versatile yet aggressive silicon fuzz $301 $270.90 BC109 Fuzz Skreddy Pedals Ripping high gain fuzz $259 $233.10 Also Purchased Products Mayo MkIII Skreddy Pedals Aggressive wall of fuzz $385 $346.50 ZERO Skreddy Pedals Extra aggressive cutting fuzz $385 $346.50 Cookie Preferences We rely on cookies for storing your shopping cart and regional settings between visits. Functionality Cookies &mdash; Shopping cart, language, and regional preferences Personalization Cookies &mdash; Remember your preferences across visits Analytics Cookies &mdash; Help us understand how visitors use our site Advertising Cookies &mdash; Used to serve and measure relevant ads Ad User Data &mdash; Sends user data to Google for advertising purposes Personalized Ads &mdash; Shows ads tailored to your interests Security Cookies &mdash; Always active, required for site security Apply Cancel Effect Types Boost Overdrive Fuzz Delay Modulation Octave Utilities all Account Create Account Login Information Terms and Conditions Cookie Policy Privacy Policy Cookie Preferences Contact Skreddy Pedals 3170 N Deer Run Rd Ste 12 Carson City, NV 89701 USA +1-916-749-6259 \"> Copy